  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This support is to pilot projects in three countries - Kenya, South Africa and Zambia - to develop coordinated responses and policy recommmendations for rape survivors by police, health services and judiciary. A further four countries are linked into a Pop council led regional network for GBV responses and policy/protocol development.</narrative>
